I realised the package headers are not unified after a review from Thomas
Petazzoni. This is an attempt at fixing that. The changes were done using
scripts and then reviewed by hand.

Main changes are:
 - add a line between the header and the rest of the makefile
 - use lower case for the package name
 - remove useless description and url from the header and move it to the Config.in when necessary
 - use 80 hashes for the separators

Alexandre Belloni (7):
  ccid: fix header line
  Fix package headers to comply with coding style
  x-loader: remove useless comment
  imlib2: fix header
  Convert headers to lower case when relevant
  Remove description and url from header
  Normalize separator size to 80

